  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the preparation of an action in the Agriculture TVET sector in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this action is to assist the EUD in Rwanda with specific input, intelligence and recommendations for the preparation of the future project &#xbf;Strengthened Access to and Quality of TVET in the Agriculture sector in Rwanda&#xbf;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Specific Objectives of this action are to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;To produce and disseminate intelligence and data for national stakeholders and EUD on current and future skills needs in the agricultural sector, to be compared with existing TVET training offer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Increased awareness of centres of vocational excellence among national stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Relevant intelligence and technical input feed the new EU action&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
